  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When you enter a station, a few values don't get reset to default values. `Velocity` and `isGrounded` is some of them that is stuck in the state they were in before you entered the station. Which we also have no control over.\n\n---\nCould also be that this is intended, but filling a bug report so that a clear answer can be given, and possibly fixed/updated documentation to include this.\n\n**Repo example;**\n- Stand by a station\n- Jump\n- Enter station mid jump\n- Look at the avatar debug menu\n- See `isGrounded` is False, while you're in the station.\n- Exit station \n- `isGrounded` is now True\n\nIt's the same for Velocity",
